    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        290,
        1647,
        1434,
        1898
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(c) No person shall be considered or evaluated by the Committee for any position covered by this Order while serving as a member of the Committee. In the event that the Committee deter mines to consider any member of the Committee for appointment and the member consents to being considered for appointment, then said member shall resign from the Committee immediately and shall be precluded from participating in the functions of the Committee in any respect. The Mayor shall fill the vacancy created by said resigning member as promptly as reasonably practicable.",
